Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.65,0:00:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别悲伤 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't grieve, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:30.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我必须做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牺牲小我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The needs of the many outweigh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是自我牺牲...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the needs of the few.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能成全大我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我永远都是你最好的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been and always shall be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿你平安快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live long and prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.89,0:01:09.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们今天齐聚在这里送我们的战友最后一程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are assembled here today to pay final respects to our honoured dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的死亡象徵着新的生命...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This death takes place in the shadow of new life,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带来了新的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sunrise of a new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他牺牲了生命去保卫这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world that our beloved comrade gave his life to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.87,0:01:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不觉得他的牺牲是无谓的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did not feel this sacrifice a vain or empty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.63,0:01:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我所有的朋友中...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of my friend, I can only say this:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在进取号所有的成员中...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all the souls I have encountered in my travels,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他才是最具...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his was the most...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人性的一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...human.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬礼 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honours. Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太空是最终的边境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Space, the final frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星舰进取号将要继续执行任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the continuing voyages of the Starship Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:29.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去探索陌生的国度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her ongoing mission to explore strange new worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去寻找新的生命跟新的文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To seek out new lifeforms and new civilisations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勇往直前...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To boldly go...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,航行到无人踏足过的领域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where no man has gone before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《星际迷航3：石破天惊》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进取号舰长航行日志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}USS Enterprise, Captain's Personal Log.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重创修复后 我们立即返航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With most of our battle damage repaired, we're almost home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我却感到心神不宁 我也不知道原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet I feel uneasy. And I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:52.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是因为这艘星舰太空旷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps it is the emptiness of this vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大部分人员都已经被重新分配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of our trainee crew has been reassigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莎维可军官与我的儿子大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Saavik and my son David
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.31,0:06:02.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在他创造出来的创世星上继续进行实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are exploring the Genesis planet, which he helped create.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而进取号就像一间人去楼空的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Enterprise feels like a house with all the children gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:11.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 比那感觉更空虚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, more empty even than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克之死 就像一道永不愈合的伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The death of Spock is like an open wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:21.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我似乎将我最崇高的部分...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems that I've left the noblest part of myself back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遗留在创世星上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on that newborn planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏鲁 报告情况 好的 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Status, Mr Sulu. On course, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计在2.1个小时后到达地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Estimating space dock in 2.1 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好 契可夫 我要在到达前进行一次扫瞄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well. Mr Chekov, I'll need a pre-approach scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请到科学站去 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the science station, please. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌胡拉...进行创世计划的星舰有任何回应吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura... Any response from Starfleet on our Project Genesis enquiries?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰长 没有任何反应 这非常奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, there is no response. That's very odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特 进度报告 快完成了 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, progress report. It's almost done, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星舰在抵达地球时 将可以恢复正常操作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be fully automated by the time we dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:07:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间配合的非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent timing. You fixed the barn door after the horse has come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后还要修理多久我们才可以再次出航?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much refit time till we can take her out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八星期 但是因为时间紧迫 我会在两星期内完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight weeks, sir. But you don't have eight weeks, so I'll do it in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:14.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总会把你的估计时间乘以四倍吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you always multiplied your repair estimates by a factor of four?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 不然我如何能保持工作神速的美号?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly, sir. How else can I keep my reputation as a miracle worker?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特 这个美号你当之无愧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your reputation is secure, Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏鲁 你来接管指挥我会在我的舱房内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Sulu, take the Con. I'll be in my quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰长?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:34.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到达时 他们会举行仪式吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they planning a ceremony when we get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:38.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我意思是迎接仪式 你想要英雄式的欢迎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, a reception? Would you like a hero's welcome?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, God knows there should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我们付出了很大的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time we've paid for the party with our dearest blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镇定一点...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady. Steady, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.63,0:08:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续扫瞄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为可以信赖你们 他到底在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you people were reliable. Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经待在这里很久了 启动呼叫频率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been here for some time. Put me on hailing frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柯鲁奇司令...这是瓦克莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Kruge... This is Valkris.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经获得创世计划的资料 可以随时传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have purchased the Genesis data. Ready to transmit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好 瓦克莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Valkris.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么一回事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解除隐形罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disengage cloaking device!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传送资料 开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transmit data. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传送完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transmission completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会发现它很有用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will find it useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:41.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思是你已经看过了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you have seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 司令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太不幸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动火箭推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.69,0:10:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事? 我何时可以拿到钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on? When do I get paid off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就可以了 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, Captain. Quite soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你成功 司令...我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Success, my Lord... and my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你将会名垂千古\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will be remembered with honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新方向 联邦中立地带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New course. Federation neutral zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:11:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 司令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制中心 这里是进取号 已经准备返航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approach Control, this is Enterprise, ready for docking manoeuvre.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进取号可以返航了 锁定系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enterprise is cleared to dock. Lock on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.07,0:11:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统已经锁定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Systems locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.99,0:11:49.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太空中心 让你们来控制了 没问题 进取号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spacedock, you have control. Affirmative, Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.37,0:11:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,享受旅程 欢迎返航 进取号确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy the ride, and welcome home. Enterprise confirms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告 己关闭大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Acknowledge, doors closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:31.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看看那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个很伟大的发明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends, the great experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:42.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就是精益号 已经随时可以试航了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Excelsior. Ready for trial runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:47.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它应该配备了超级曲速引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's supposed to have transwarp drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它真是太先进了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if my grandmother had wheels, she'd be a wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时代进步了 史考特 接受新事物吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young minds, fresh ideas. Be tolerant, Mr Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悬挂及重力系统...准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standby umbilical and gravitational support systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.89,0:13:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道 长官 开始停泊 所有系统进入准备状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir, moorings activated, all systems standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 这太不可能了 契可夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral. This is not possible. Mr Chekov.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克的房间有能量的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An energy reading from 'C' deck, from inside Mr Spock's quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经下令封锁他的房间 是我亲自封锁的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ordered Spock's quarters sealed. I sealed the room myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是里面显示有生命的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevertheless, I am reading a lifeform there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为了史波克都快发疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This entire crew seems on the edge of obsessive behaviour regarding Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:14:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全系统报告 有人闯入史波克的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Security reports the door to Spock's quarters has been forced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上赶去 苏鲁 继续停泊程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on my way. Sulu, continue docking procedures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆士...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我留在创世星 你为何要这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You left me on Genesis. Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考伊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:21.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我 詹姆士 带我回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me, Jim. Take me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考伊 我们已经到家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, we are. We are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么或许还不太晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then perhaps it's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爬上阶梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb the steps, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:40.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爬上史莱亚山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb the steps of Mount Seleya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史莱亚山?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mount Seleya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考伊 史莱亚山在瓦肯星 我们己回到地球了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, Mount Seleya's on Vulcan. We're home... on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:54.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 己完成降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral, docking is completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星际舰队的马洛将军 已经在等候检阅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet Commander Morrow is on his way for inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌胡拉 快叫医护人员来这儿 叫他们马上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura, get the medics down here! Get them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在最艰难的情况下 完成了非凡的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've all done remarkable service under the most difficult conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们将会收到星际舰队最高的赞赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be receiving Starfleet's highest commendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更重要的是特别延长的假期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And more importantly... extended shore leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了史考特先生以外 因为精益号需要你的帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All but you, Mr Scott. They need your wisdom on the new Excelsior.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:32.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天去那里报到 是工程舰长的职位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report there tomorrow as Captain of Engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:37.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很感激 但我宁愿留下来修理进取号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all appreciation, I'd prefer to supervise the refit of Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕那己不需要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 长官...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:46.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 史考特先生 进取号将不会被修理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Mr Scott, but there will be no refit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 我不明白 进取号并不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral... I don't understand. The Enterprise is not...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:57.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进取号已有20年的舰龄 我们觉得它应该退役了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, the Enterprise is 20 years old. We feel her day is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们已经要求...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we had requested...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们希望带它回去创世星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had hoped to take her back to Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是不可能的 我可以知道原因吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is out of the question. May I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能不知道 创世星惹起了很大的争议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your absence, Genesis has become a galactic controversy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在星球联邦议会定下政策之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until the Federation Council makes policy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们绝对不能跟任何人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are all under orders not to discuss with anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谈论关於创世星的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your knowledge of Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.37,0:17:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就将它当成是被隔离的星球 被禁止谈论的话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider it a quarantine planet... and a forbidden subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了明白这个事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To understand the events on which I report, it is necessary to review
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们必须了解创世机的理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the theoretical data on the Genesis device,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创世机是由两位马库斯博士所研究的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as developed by Doctors Carol and David Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们希望从无生命的环境中创造出生命来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genesis, simply put, is life from lifelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把创世机放到一颗没有生命的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The device was to be introduced into a pre-selected area
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:18:01.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如一颗月球或其他的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a lifeless space body, a moon or other dead form.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个装置会马上产生创世效应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The device would instantaneously cause the Genesis efect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将一个无生命的月球变成一个生气盎然的行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead of a dead moon, a living, breathing planet now exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够维持任何生命体的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}capable of sustaining whatever life forms we see fit to deposit on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是很值得控制的强大力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great power to control, dominate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说 非常厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak. Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们可以创造出一个行星来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can make a planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:52.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 新的城市、新的家园...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. New cities, homes in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妻子跟孩子都陪伴在你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your woman at your side, children playing at your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:19:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且星球联邦的旗子 会在头上随风飘扬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And overhead, fluttering in the breeze, the flag of the Federation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到岗位上 是的 司令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Station. Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟任何人提起这件事 明白 司令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Share this with no one. Understood, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要前往那颗行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going to this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.40,0:19:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我们的使者 正在跟星球联邦议和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even as our emissaries negotiate for peace with the Federation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是为了保护我们的人民 我们必须采取行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will act for the preservation of our race.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:28.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将要夺取这个秘密武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will seize the secret of this weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个超级秘密武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The secret of ultimate power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你成功 司令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Success, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:20:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经抵达035方位的行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have reached the destination planet at point 035.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好 中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well, Lieutenant. Helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制室 以标准轨道前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Execute standard orbital approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:13.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传送密码口信给星际舰队司令 第一优先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send a coded message for Starfleet Commander, Priority One.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星联科学太空舰葛里松号刚刚抵达创世星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Federation science vessel Grissom arriving Genesis, Mutara Sector,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.05,0:20:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即将开始进行实验 指挥官艾斯塔班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"to begin research. J.T. Esteban commanding."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:26.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马库斯博士 这是你的行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr Marcus, it's your planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请开始扫瞄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begin scanning, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莎维可 好玩的地方现在才开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where the fun begins, Saavik.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:37.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你父亲一样 太像人类了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like your father, so human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有单位启动 开动记录器 扫瞄领域一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units functional. Recorders are on. Scanning Sector 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树叶生长茂盛 气温摄氏22.2度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The foliage in fully developed state of growth. Temperature 22.2 Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,领域二是沙漠地带 极少量植物 气温39.4\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sector 2 indicating desert terrain. Minimal vegetation. Temperature 39.4.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,领域三是亚热带植物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sector 3, sub-tropical vegetation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.01,0:21:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气温急速下降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Temperature decreasing rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雪 这个领域会下雪 真是难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's snow. Snow in the same sector. Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迷人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:18.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个小星球具备了地球上的各种地形与天气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the varieties of land and weather known to Earth, within hours' walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有金属物体 执行短距离扫瞄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metallic mass. Close range scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一个光量子管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A photon tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重力场显示它是安全著陆的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gravitational fields were in flux. It must have soft landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上通知星际舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In code to Starfleet:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克舰长的棺木位於创世星的表面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Captain Spock's tube located on Genesis surface."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人无法置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.47,0:21:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果设备运行正常的话 讯号显示有动物生命迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If equipment is functioning properly, indications are an animal lifeform.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.73,0:21:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说那里没有动物的 是不该有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said there wouldn't be any. There shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:22:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讯号已经被证实 显示有不明生命体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cross referenced and verified. An unidentifiable lifeform reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:06.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 你要通知星际舰队吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish to advise Starfleet, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们根本不知道那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know what we're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为何不将他传送上来? 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we beam it up? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,条例清楚说明：除非不会有被污染的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regulations state, "Nothing shall be beamed aboard"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则任何东西都不能被传送上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"until danger of contamination is eliminated."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰长 我们可以派人下去检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, beaming down to the surface is permitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.50,0:22:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非任务是必要而且安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the Captain decides that the mission is vital and reasonably safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.47,0:22:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须查明那是什么 或者是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, we must see what it is. Or who.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.43,0:22:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬缺席的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absent friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.19,0:22:44.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 进取号将会如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral, what's going to happen to the Enterprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会退役 我们会有另一艘星舰吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's to be decommissioned. Will we get another ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 星际舰队正忙于参加宇宙会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get an answer. Starfleet's up to its brass in galactic conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.33,0:22:57.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人有空处理这种不要紧的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one has time for those who stand and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.33,0:23:00.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考伊医生如何了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, about Dr McCoy, how is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.67,0:23:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被注射了很多镇定剂 正在家里修养\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's home, resting comfortably, pumped full of tranquilizers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.01,0:23:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说他是精疲力竭 他保证会在家好好修养\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say it's exhaustion. He promised he'd stay put. We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.55,0:23:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是史考特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, Mr Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.39,0:23:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:27.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙瑞克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarek!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.36,0:23:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大使 我不知道你会来 你应该见过我的舰队人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambassador, I had no idea you were here. I believe you know my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.29,0:23:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想单独跟你谈谈 寇克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will speak with you alone, Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家回避一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.13,0:23:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大使 我应该前去瓦肯星 向你慰问一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambassador, I would have come to Vulcan to express my deep sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.26,0:23:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,省省这些陈腔滥调 我已经去过你们的星联政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spare me your human platitudes, Kirk. I have been to your Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.05,0:23:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看过创世星的资料 还有你的报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have seen the Genesis information, and your own report.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.39,0:24:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你应该知道 你儿子是非常勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you know how bravely your son met his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.69,0:24:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何将他留在创世星?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you leave him on Genesis?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.19,0:24:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克很信任你 但是你却离弃了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock trusted you. And you denied him his future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.07,0:24:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有离弃他 他只是身体死亡而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw no future. Only his body was in death, Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.66,0:24:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是最后跟他在一起的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you were the last one to be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.54,0:24:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必定知道 你应该将他带回瓦肯星去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you must know that you should have come with him to Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.62,0:24:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么? 因为他要求你这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why? Because he asked you to!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他将他肉体以外的东西...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He entrusted you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.38,0:24:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都交托给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with his very essence, with everything that was not of the body!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.34,0:24:37.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要求你把他带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked you to bring him to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.22,0:24:42.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他的灵魂带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to bring that which he gave you: His Katra. His living spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.89,0:24:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.77,0:24:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常疼爱你的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son meant more to me than you can know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.61,0:24:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意用我的生命去交换他的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd have given my life if it would have saved his.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.57,0:24:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是诘你相信我 他没有要求我带他回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me when I tell you... he made no request of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.37,0:25:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是没有公开说出来而己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would not have spoken of it openly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.50,0:25:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我怎会知道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how was...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要进入你的思想 可以吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have your thoughts. May I join your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.71,0:25:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.78,0:25:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他谈到跟你的友谊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He spoke of your friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.91,0:25:39.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.49,0:25:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他...叫你别悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He... asked you not to grieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.79,0:25:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.29,0:25:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牺牲小我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The needs of the many...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.42,0:25:55.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...outweigh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.22,0:26:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自我牺牲...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the needs of the few...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.26,0:26:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能成全大我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.89,0:26:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.15,0:26:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我永远都是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.36,0:26:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and always shall be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.99,0:26:22.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿你平安快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live long and prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.33,0:26:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.89,0:26:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.31,0:26:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.52,0:26:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为他的灵魂 已经跟你结合在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had assumed he mind-melded with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.31,0:26:54.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是瓦肯星人的求存方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the Vulcan way... when the body's end is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.11,0:26:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被分开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.53,0:27:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没办法摸到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He couldn't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.99,0:27:04.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.54,0:27:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么他的一切...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then everything that he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他拥有的知识...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...everything he knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.92,0:27:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.68,0:27:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.85,0:27:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果事情那么重要 他一定会找别的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would have found a way. If there was that much at stake,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.61,0:27:37.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克一定会找别的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock would have found a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.28,0:27:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 但是他会如何做呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.62,0:27:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许他会将灵魂附在其他人身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if he joined with someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.12,0:27:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎室 飞行录影记录 星历8128.78\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engine Room, Flight Recorder Visual. Star date 8128. 78.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.17,0:27:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.80,0:28:00.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星舰安全吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ship... out of danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.18,0:28:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回带 0.77\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back, 0.77.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.35,0:28:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞行影像记录 28.77\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight Recorder Visual, 28. 77.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止 你这样会让引擎室淹没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! You'll flood the whole compartment!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.69,0:28:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会没命的 舰长 他已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll die. Captain! He's dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.32,0:28:19.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回带 0.76\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back, 0.76.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.24,0:28:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞行影像记录 28.76\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight Recorder Visual, 28. 76.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.04,0:28:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要进去 也许你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going in there! Perhaps you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.21,0:28:37.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特的情况如何? 我猜他大概...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is Mr Scott's condition? I don't think that he...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.59,0:28:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我没时间跟你详细解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Doctor, I have no time to discuss this logically.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.72,0:28:46.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.55,0:28:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复播放...放大画面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat... and augment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.39,0:28:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记著...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.15,0:28:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是麦考伊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.11,0:29:02.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,个生存 一个死亡 但是双方都很痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One alive, one not. Yet both in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在该如何做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.03,0:29:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须带他们到瓦肯星的史莱亚山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must bring them to Mount Seleya on Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.24,0:29:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在那里 他们才会找到平安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only there can both find peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.66,0:29:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个要求...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.33,0:29:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的非常困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.88,0:29:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寇克 你会有办法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will find a way, Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.05,0:29:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要帮助他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you honour them both, you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.76,0:29:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.98,0:29:36.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.77,0:29:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传送室 请准备传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transporter Room, stand by to energise.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.15,0:29:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道 长官 正在准备传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir, energising now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.50,0:30:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号通知莎维可 我们探测到生命体的辐射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grissom to Saavik. We're picking up radiation from the lifeform.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.09,0:30:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道 舰长 我们的读数仍然很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Affirmative, Captain. Our readings are well below danger level.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.30,0:30:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万要小心 中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exercise caution, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.72,0:30:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次行动是由我批准的 我需要对你们的安全负贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This landing is Captain's discretion, and I'm the one who's out on a limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.52,0:30:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会记著这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll try to remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.04,0:30:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们探测到的只是棺木表面的细菌而己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are your lifeforms. These were microbes on the tube's surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.67,0:30:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从进取号射它们下来的 它们繁殖的很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shot them here from Enterprise. They were fruitful and multiplied.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.17,0:30:50.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么它们进化的那么快呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how could they have evolved so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.86,0:31:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莎维可...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saavik...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.95,0:31:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.16,0:31:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是史波克的尸衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock's burial robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.97,0:31:38.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不可以 詹姆斯 你是我最好的军官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, absolutely not, Jim. You're my best officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.23,0:31:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我是星舰的司令官 我不可以违反条例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I am Commander, Starfleet, so I don't break rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.35,0:31:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟我说什么条例 我说的是忠实跟牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't quote rules to me. I'm talking about loyalty and sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.44,0:31:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们牺牲了一个队员 另一个也有严重的精神问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One man who's died for us, another with deep emotional problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.07,0:31:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次关于史波克跟麦考伊的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This business about Spock and McCoy...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.07,0:31:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说 我也不了解瓦肯星的魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, I never understood Vulcan mysticism.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.12,0:32:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用相信他们 我也不知道我是否相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to believe. I'm not even sure that I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.83,0:32:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果史波克的灵魂 真的留下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if there's even a chance that Spock has an eternal soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.75,0:32:11.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就有责任帮助他 你的责任?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then it's my responsibility. Yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.38,0:32:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对是我的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As surely as if it were my very own.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.51,0:32:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你把进取号还给我 只要有史考特的帮忙...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me back the Enterprise. With Scotty's help I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.68,0:32:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道进取号是不能再飞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise would never stand the pounding, and you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.48,0:32:29.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我就租一艘太空舰 不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll hire a ship. Out of the question, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.15,0:32:34.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦议会已经下令 只有科学部队可以到创世星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Council has ordered that no one but the science team goes to Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.03,0:32:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的生命跟事业代表著理智 不是冲动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your life and your career stand for rationality, not intellectual chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.87,0:32:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你继续这样 你将会失去一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep up this emotional behaviour and you'll lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.21,0:32:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你将会前途尽毁 你明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll destroy yourself. Do you understand me, Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.21,0:32:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.63,0:32:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试着帮忙而己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.51,0:32:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:33:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the drink. Any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.86,0:33:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了? 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The word, sir? The word...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.61,0:33:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我还是会去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is no. I am therefore going anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.11,0:33:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会帮助你的 要通知麦考伊医生吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can count on our help, sir. Shall I alert Dr McCoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.66,0:33:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 他将要飞很远的路程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. He has a long journey ahead of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.35,0:33:46.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久不见 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long time, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.85,0:33:49.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 有人找我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Anybody been looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在找你呢 你要喝什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have, but what's the use? What'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.98,0:33:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛郎星的水 你很少喝这种毒药的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Altair water. That's not your usual poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.86,0:34:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来酒馆喝毒药 好像不是太合理吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To expect one to order poison in a bar is not logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.25,0:34:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.01,0:34:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬你的行星 欢迎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To your planet, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:26.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该是我说的 外星人 请原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's my line, stranger. Oh, forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.27,0:34:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是新丁 你却是鼎鼎大名进取号的麦考伊医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I here am new. But you are known, being McCoy from Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.69,0:34:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的处境好像很不利 我的名字并不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have me at a disadvantage, sir. I name not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.78,0:34:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你找我的 我收到你的讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seek I. Message received.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.16,0:34:46.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经为你准备好太空舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Available ship stands by.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.58,0:34:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要多少钱? 何时可以起程?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much and how soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.42,0:34:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就可以起程 价钱要看你想去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How soon is now. How much is where.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.55,0:35:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米塔拉领域 那儿是禁区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere in the Mutara Sector. Oh, Mutara restricted!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.14,0:35:06.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要许可证跟很多的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take permits many. Money more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.47,0:35:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不会有许可证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There aren't going to be any damn permits!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.81,0:35:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,违法的事怎么会有许可证?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you get a permit to do a damn illegal thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.40,0:35:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写下你的价钱 我付钱给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look... Price you name, money I got!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.48,0:35:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写下目的地 我才决定价钱 不然就没有交易了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place you name, money I name, otherwise bargain, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.37,0:35:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我要去创世星...是创世星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, dammit! Genesis. The name of the place we're going is Genesis!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.87,0:35:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创世星?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genesis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.04,0:35:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 是创世星 你的大耳朵有问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Genesis! How can you be deaf with ears like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.42,0:35:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创世星是禁区!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genesis allowed is not! It's planet forbidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.72,0:35:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创世星的确是禁区 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, my backward friend. Genesis may be planet forbidden, but I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.43,0:35:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉 先生 你不该公开讨论这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I'm sorry. You don't want to be discussing this subject in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.10,0:35:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢谈什么就谈什么 你到底是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll discuss what I like! And who in the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.44,0:35:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我送你回家吗? 麦考伊医生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like a ride home, Dr McCoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.57,0:36:04.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻子 如果我要回家 我还会租太空舰吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I wanted a ride home, would I be trying to charter a space flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.87,0:36:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么会知道我的名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How in the hell do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.75,0:36:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是联邦警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federation Security, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.38,0:36:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得好好休息一下 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get a nice long rest, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.57,0:36:50.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莎维可通知葛里松号 我们探测到另一种生命体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saavik to Grissom. We are definitely reading a second lifeform.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.33,0:36:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也探测到 请你小心行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We concur. Proceed with caution, Saavik.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面到底发生了什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.80,0:37:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 我们得快点 他们要将他移去联邦精神病院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be quick, Admiral. They're moving him to the Federation 'Funny Farm'.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.80,0:37:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可怜的朋友 我听说他很不稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, poor friend. I hear he's fruity as a nutcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.22,0:37:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.81,0:37:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.73,0:37:21.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比出多少根手指头? 那一点都不有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many fingers do I have up? That's not very damn funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.65,0:37:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的幽默感恢复了 当然 那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sense of humour has returned. The hell it has. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.99,0:37:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清醒药 用来作什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lexorin. Lexorin? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.62,0:37:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被瓦肯星人的灵魂附上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're suffering from a Vulcan mind-meld, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.12,0:37:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个绿血的王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That green-blooded son-of-a-bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.67,0:37:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是他辩论输给我 就对我报复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's his revenge for all those arguments he lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.38,0:37:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看你的手 这会让你旅行时的状态好点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see your hand. This will make you well enough to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.34,0:37:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寇克将军在哪儿? 在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Admiral Kirk? With the prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.76,0:37:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快叫他出来 星联司令要他马上过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him quickly. Commander, Starfleet, wants him right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.98,0:38:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忙碌的一天?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeping you busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.61,0:38:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别自以为聪明 小个子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get smart, Tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.20,0:38:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 星联... 你快来看 他病得很严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral, Starfleet... This man's sick. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.08,0:38:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搭右侧的电梯 执法人员已经赶来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Side elevator. Agents on their way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.59,0:38:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别叫我小个子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't call me Tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.52,0:38:38.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二单位 这里是第一单位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unit Two, this is unit One.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.44,0:38:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正要前往乐土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Koyabashi Maru has set sail for the promised land.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.94,0:38:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消息收到 将会通知所有单位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Message acknowledged. All units will be informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.15,0:38:48.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要带我去乐土?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're taking me to the promised land?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.07,0:38:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁叫我们是朋友呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are friends for?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.71,0:39:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特先生...今晚到此为止?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Scott... Calling it a night?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.96,0:39:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 老实说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Turning in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.00,0:39:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很期望明天能打破进取号的速度纪录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking forward to breaking some of Enterprise's speed records tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.09,0:39:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.22,0:39:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请告知层数 输送室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Level, please. Transporter Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.68,0:39:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 要你们好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Up your shaft!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.43,0:39:21.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旧城控制室一切正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger, Old City Station at 22.00 hours. All is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.27,0:39:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道 所有控制室都维持正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood. All stations clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.44,0:39:25.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令 你让我感到很惊愕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You amaze me, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.19,0:39:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以一个20年经验的老手 你竟然选择最差的控制室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A 20-year space veteran, you choose the worst duty station in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.57,0:39:34.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看这个地方 这里非常偏僻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, look at this place! This is the hind end of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.83,0:39:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我却认为这里很安宁平静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peace and quiet appeals to me, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.41,0:39:43.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许快退休的人才会喜欢这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that's okay for someone like you, whose career is winding down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.46,0:39:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我却需要一些挑战和冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But me, I need some challenge in my life, adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.55,0:39:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许只是一两个惊喜都不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe even just a surprise or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.67,0:39:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心你许下的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know what they say. Be careful what you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.72,0:39:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们或许会成真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.85,0:40:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安 指挥官 一切都安好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, Commander. Is everything ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.77,0:40:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 请进入我的接待室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step into my parlour, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.48,0:40:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天 那是寇克将军 你说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Admiral Kirk, my God. Very good for you, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.53,0:40:12.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这很不合规则 没有目的地指示跟身分证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's damn irregular. No destination orders, no encoded IDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.99,0:40:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也没错 我们应该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All true. What are we going to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.49,0:40:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都不做 但你却必须进去衣橱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to do anything, but you're going to sit in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.20,0:40:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你发疯了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you lost all your sense of reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.58,0:40:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.92,0:40:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是幻想 你不是要冒险吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is fantasy. You wanted adventure, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.76,0:40:34.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是否感到兴奋刺激呢? 好小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old adrenalin going, huh? Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.43,0:40:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在进去衣橱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.06,0:40:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续走 我会进去衣橱里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on. Go on! I'll just get in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.39,0:40:44.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.36,0:40:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴你愿意帮忙 你应付得来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you're on our side. Can you handle that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.57,0:40:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会应付那个冒险小子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have Mr Adventure eating out of my hand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.74,0:40:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到时在老地方见 还有将军...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll see all of you at the rendezvous. And Admiral...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.33,0:41:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我祝福你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就如我所保证的 它己准备就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As promised, she's all yours, sir. All systems automated and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.02,0:41:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一只黑猩猩和两个新兵都可以驾驶它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chimpanzee and two trainees could run her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.19,0:41:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 史考特 我会试着不去在意你说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr Scott. I'll try not to take that personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.78,0:41:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友们 我不能再要求你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends, I can't ask you to go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.82,0:41:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和麦考伊医生必须这么做 但是你们不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr McCoy and I have to do this. The rest of you do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.16,0:41:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 我们在浪费宝贵的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral, we're losing precious time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.41,0:41:48.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请告知航线 将军? 史考特?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What course, please, Admiral? Mr Scott?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.79,0:41:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 请你下达命令吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be grateful, Admiral, if you'd give the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.01,0:42:00.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 希望我们一路顺风 请各就各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen... May the wind be at our backs. Stations, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.27,0:42:06.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动自动系统 是的 己启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage auto systems. Aye. Engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.19,0:42:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解除停泊程序 己解除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear all moorings. Cleared, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.81,0:42:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四分一推动力 四分一推动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One quarter impulse power. One quarter impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.29,0:42:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星联司令紧急呼叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander, Starfleet, on emergency channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.96,0:42:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他下令你立刻交出太空舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He orders you to surrender this vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.42,0:42:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契可夫 别答覆 苏鲁 平稳的开动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No reply, Chekov. Steady as she goes, Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.68,0:42:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色警戒 舰长立刻回复舰桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yellow Alert. Captain to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.85,0:42:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是舰长 太空停泊处怎么可能有黄色警戒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Captain. How can you have a Yellow Alert in spacedock?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.48,0:42:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人正在偷取进取号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, someone is stealing the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.82,0:42:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.07,0:43:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色警戒 所有控制室 黄色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yellow Alert. All stations, Yellow Alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.16,0:43:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色警戒 所有控制室 黄色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yellow Alert. All stations, Yellow Alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.33,0:43:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一分钟后到达太空门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute to spacedoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.88,0:43:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要硬闽过大门吗? 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna walk through them? Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.14,0:43:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精益号正启动引擎 准备追赶我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir. Excelsior powering up with orders to pursue.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.93,0:43:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yellow Alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.64,0:43:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Status.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.27,0:43:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自动系统已经准备就绪 取消自动停泊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All automates ready and functioning. Automatic moorings retracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.19,0:43:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级曲速引擎已经准备妥当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All speeds available through Transwarp Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.19,0:43:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很优秀的太空舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.32,0:43:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制室 四分之一推动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helm. One quarter impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.71,0:43:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三十秒后到达太空门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty seconds to spacedoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.25,0:44:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告 太空门紧闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, secured spacedoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.59,0:44:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告 太空门紧闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, secured spacedoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.34,0:44:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在 史考特 长官?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, Mr Scott. Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.14,0:44:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开大门 史考特 我知道 我正在想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doors, Mr Scott! Aye, sir, I'm workin' on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.69,0:44:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险 太空门紧闭 危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danger, spacedoors are closed. Danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.14,0:44:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们己完全通过太空门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have cleared spacedoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.94,0:45:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开启全速推动力 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full impulse power. Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.62,0:45:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牵引杆准备 牵引杆己被开动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standby tractor beam. Tractor beam, on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.25,0:45:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他想用曲速引擎逃走 他准备大开眼界吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he tries to get away with Warp Drive, he's in for a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.69,0:45:39.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精益号接近至四千公尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excelsior closing to 4,000 metres, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.27,0:45:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特 是你表演的时候了 准备开动曲速引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll need everything you have. Warp Drive standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.49,0:45:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寇克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.24,0:45:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你这么做 你将失去舰长的位子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do this, you'll never sit in the Captain's chair again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.28,0:45:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曲速引擎 是的 曲速引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warp Speed. Aye, sir. Warp Speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.54,0:46:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备开动曲速引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for Warp Speed. Stand by Transwarp Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.63,0:46:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曲速引擎己准备妥当 开动全力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transwarp at your command. Full power available.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.76,0:46:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,执行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Execute.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...power available.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.32,0:46:26.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动全力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full power available.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.45,0:46:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曲速引擎全速前进 五、四、三、二、一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transwarp Drive, maximum velocity in five, four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.09,0:46:53.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特 做得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, as good as your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.10,0:46:58.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越先进的引擎 越容易被破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more they overtake the plumbing, the easier to stop up the drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.56,0:47:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个给你 医生 我给你的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, Doctor, souvenirs from one surgeon to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.15,0:47:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从他们的曲速引擎拿下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took them out of her main Transwarp computer drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.82,0:47:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢你们预先告诉我 你没来参加开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice of you to tell me in advance. You missed the staff meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.91,0:47:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们今天的表现非常杰出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your work today has been outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.24,0:47:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论未来你们被派到什么单位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will recommend you all for promotion...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.74,0:47:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都会尽力推荐你们 全力向创世星前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in whatever fleet we end up serving. Best speed to Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.65,0:48:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是莎维可 你会说话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Saavik. Can you speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.08,0:48:42.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创世波可能让他的细胞复活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Genesis Wave. His cells could have been regenerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.54,0:48:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰长 我是莎维可 诘回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, this is Saavik. Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.92,0:48:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 莎维可 请说 我们己找到生命体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Saavik, go ahead. We have found the life sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.26,0:48:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个瓦肯男孩 大约是地球上的八至十岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a Vulcan child, perhaps eight to ten Earth years of age.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.05,0:49:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男孩? 他如何来到那里的? 马库斯博士认为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A child?! How did he get there? It is Dr Marcus' opinion that...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.77,0:49:11.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创世波让史波克舰长复活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that the Genesis effect has in some way regenerated... Captain Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.20,0:49:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莎维可 这真是...太异常了 你打算怎么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saavik, that's... extraordinary. What would you like to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.25,0:49:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请批准马上传送上太空舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Request permission to beam aboard immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.12,0:49:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马库斯博士认为 他有感染辐射的可能性吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does Dr Marcus think there's any chance of radioactive contamination?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.13,0:49:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 他没侦察到任何辐射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. None that he can detect, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.80,0:49:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得通知星际舰队 希望他们能给予指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to advise Starfleet and get instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.60,0:49:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定星际舰队会批准的 但我们还是照规矩来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure Starfleet would approve. But let's do it by the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.10,0:49:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备收发无线电报 开始传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standby on this channel. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.23,0:49:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星际舰队控制室 葛里松号正在密码98.8频道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet Command, this is USS Grissom on coded channel 98.8.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.94,0:49:54.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.91,0:50:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的电报被干扰 是一股很强的能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, something is jamming our transmission. An energy surge.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.87,0:50:06.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探查出位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locate!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.25,0:50:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从太空舰后方而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, it's from astern!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.13,0:50:16.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.80,0:50:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炮手...瞄准他们的引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner... Target engine only.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.43,0:50:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰长 发生了什么事? 我们受到攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, what is happening? We're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.44,0:50:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备躲避\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by for evasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.02,0:50:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.86,0:50:41.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要俘虏他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted prisoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.78,0:50:45.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射得太准确了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lucky shot, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.63,0:50:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.17,0:50:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令 我可以建议... 说错话你就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, may I suggest... Say the wrong thing, Torg!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.42,0:51:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星球上有生命的迹象 或许是你想找的科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are life signs on the planet. Perhaps the very scientists you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.47,0:51:05.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莎维可呼叫葛里松号... 非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saavik calling Grissom... Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.56,0:51:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号 莎维可在紧急频道 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grissom, this is Saavik on emergency frequency. Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.57,0:51:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们发生了什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.53,0:51:21.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号似乎被敌人击落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would seem the Grissom was destroyed by an enemy attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.41,0:51:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须走了 他们很快就会来追杀我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must go. They will soon come after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.91,0:51:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计用现在的时速前进2.9钟头后就会到达创世星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Estimating Genesis, 2.9 hours present speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.92,0:51:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能保持这个速度吗? 可以 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we hold speed, Scotty? Aye, she's got her second wind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.34,0:51:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扫瞄有无追赶在后的太空舰 扫瞄 没有显示任何太空舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scan for vessels in pursuit. Scanning. Indications negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.18,0:51:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做得对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I get it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.10,0:51:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好 麦考伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, Bones, just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.51,0:52:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们坦白一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for total truth between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.85,0:52:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个行星并不如你期望一般 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This planet is not what you intended or hoped for, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.90,0:52:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.27,0:52:40.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.57,0:52:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在创世星的母岩上用上了原始物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used proto-matter in the Genesis matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.82,0:52:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种物质非常不稳定 所有科学家都知道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An unstable substance which every ethical scientist in the galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.37,0:52:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是非常危险的材料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has denounced as dangerously unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.33,0:52:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是唯一能解决问题的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the only way to solve certain problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.21,0:53:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你父亲一样 你擅自违反规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, like your father, you changed the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.46,0:53:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不这么做 或许永远都不能实现计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I hadn't, it might have been years, or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.38,0:53:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的性急害苦了多少人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many have paid the price for your impatience?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.85,0:53:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多少人因此而死? 你造成了多少损害?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many have died? How much damage have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.31,0:53:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还会发生什么结果?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what is yet to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.81,0:54:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰桥 这里什么也没发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bridge, nothing happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.13,0:55:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个行星正在急速老化 史波克也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This planet is ageing in surges. And Spock with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.72,0:55:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们好像结合在一起 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems they're joined together. They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.14,0:55:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.85,0:55:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几天 或许几个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Days. Maybe hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.65,0:55:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.49,0:55:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克会感到很痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be hardest on Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.70,0:55:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快他就会感觉到 他体内瓦肯血液的燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon he will feel the burning of his Vulcan blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.20,0:55:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白 喷发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. Pon Farr.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.13,0:55:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓦肯男人成年后 他们必须每七年忍受一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulcan males must endure it every seventh year of their adult life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.26,0:55:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们越来越接近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever they are, they're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.60,0:56:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去吧 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我去吧 把武器给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do it. Give me your phaser.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.65,0:56:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星际舰队正在通知葛里松号 叫他们提防我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Starfleet calling USS Grissom. A warning about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.91,0:56:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的回答呢? 跟之前一样 没有回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Response? Nothing. As before.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.92,0:56:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号会怎么做? 支持我们或是攻击我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the Grissom up to? Will she join us or fire on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.80,0:56:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,契可夫 打破沉默 替我向艾斯塔班舰长致意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chekov, break silence. Send Captain Esteban my compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.76,0:56:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还好吧? 我们还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we doing? How are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.23,0:56:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这种问法真是有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny you should put it quite that way, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.31,0:56:49.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还不错 但是我宁愿让他霸占我的肾脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are doing fine. But I'd feel safer
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.69,0:56:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不喜欢让他占据我的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}giving him one of my kidneys than what's scrambled in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.15,0:56:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号没有任何回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No response from Grissom on any channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.49,0:57:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每隔一段时间就继续传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep trying. At regular intervals.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.14,0:57:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.99,0:57:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种情形叫喷发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is called Pon Farr.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.70,0:57:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喷发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pon Farr.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.75,0:57:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愿意相信我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.66,0:59:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们安全的以曲速前进 现在正要进入创世星领域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are secured from Warp Speed. Now entering Genesis Sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.91,0:59:08.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用推动力前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed at impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.30,0:59:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太空舰进入领域 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vessel entering sector. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.84,0:59:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦战斗巡航舰 他们有扫瞄到我们吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federation Battle Cruiser. Have they scanned us?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.18,0:59:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.60,0:59:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动隐形装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage cloaking device.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.55,1:00:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓那里有些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd swear there was something there, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.76,1:00:02.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.30,1:00:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一刹那间 像一台侦察舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For an instant, a scout class vessel.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.10,1:00:11.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能是葛里松号 尝试联络他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be Grissom. Patch in the hailing frequency.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.48,1:00:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号 这里是进取号 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grissom, this is Enterprise calling. Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.91,1:00:29.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号 这里是进取号 你们有收到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grissom, this is Enterprise calling. Do you read?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.16,1:00:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.68,1:00:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我大老远跑来要寻找创世机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come a long way for the power of Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.47,1:00:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do I find?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.31,1:00:56.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个懦弱的人类 一个瓦肯男孩和一个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A weakling human, a Vulcan boy and a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.23,1:00:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是考察队的幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Lord, we are survivors of a doomed expedition.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.48,1:01:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个行星很快就会毁灭 创世星实验失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This planet will destroy itself soon. The Genesis experiment is a failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.61,1:01:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失败了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A failure?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.03,1:01:11.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是最强大的毁灭力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most powerful destructive force ever created.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.54,1:01:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须告诉我创世机的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will tell me the secret of the Genesis torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.38,1:01:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.13,1:01:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么希望你喜欢享受痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I hope pain is something you enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.52,1:01:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下令不准打扰的 但是 司令...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ordered no interruptions. But, sir...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.02,1:01:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦太空舰正在接近 传我上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federation Starship approaching. Bring me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.94,1:01:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号 这里是进取号 你收到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grissom, this is Enterprise calling. Do you read?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.65,1:01:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号 这里是进取号 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grissom, this is Enterprise calling. Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.70,1:01:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争警戒状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battle Alert!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.87,1:01:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛里松号 这里是进取号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grissom, this is Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.17,1:02:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寇克将军呼叫艾斯塔班舰长 或是莎维可中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral Kirk calling Captain Esteban or Lieutenant Saavik.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.55,1:02:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告状态 我们己启动隐形装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report status. We are cloaked.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.38,1:02:10.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌方以推动力前进 距离五千太空公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enemy closing on impulse power. Range five thousand kellicams.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.89,1:02:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 这是我期待己久的好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good! This is just the turn of luck I have been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.82,1:02:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的扫瞄机没有任何发现 短距离扫瞄 契可夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing on my scanner, sir. Short-range scan, Mr Chekov.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.99,1:02:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏鲁 将影像放映出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it on visual, Mr Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.41,1:02:38.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离三千太空公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Range three thousand kellicams.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.96,1:02:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稳定住 继续开启推动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady. Continue on impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.88,1:02:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离两千太空公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Range two thousand kellicams.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.05,1:02:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备开动武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by to transfer energy to weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.97,1:02:58.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听候我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.94,1:03:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里的星光有些扭曲 看到没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There! That distortion, see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.99,1:03:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我们越接近 它就越来越大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. It's getting larger as we close in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.91,1:03:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,己在射程之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Firing range, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.83,1:03:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炮手...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.62,1:03:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只瞄准引擎 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target engine only. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.46,1:03:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常明白 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood clearly, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.76,1:03:36.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的判断为何? 苏鲁 我猜那是很强的能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opinion, Mr Sulu. I think it's an energy surge.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.01,1:03:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足够隐藏一艘太空舰? 是隐形装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough energy to hide a ship? A cloaking device.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.64,1:03:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红色警戒 史考特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red Alert, Mr Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.86,1:03:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千太空公里 正在逐渐接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thousand kellicams and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.48,1:03:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有能量集中到武器系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All power to the weapons systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.11,1:03:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.49,1:03:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有防护罩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shields?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.07,1:03:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我猜的没错 他们开火之前得先解除隐形罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my guess is right, they'll have to de-cloak before they can fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.50,1:04:01.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你的猜测是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May all your guesses be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.97,1:04:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克林贡的鸟形舰 备有武器 开火 史考特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingon Bird of Prey. Arming. Fire, Mr Scott!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.36,1:04:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射得真准 史考特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good shooting, Mr Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.53,1:04:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心戒备 契可夫 启动防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precautionary, Mr Chekov, shields up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.83,1:04:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开启火箭推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency power to the thrusters!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.42,1:04:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防护罩没有回应 史考特?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the shield's non-responsive. Scotty?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.13,1:04:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自动操作系统负荷过多 我并没预期会开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The automation system's overloaded. I didn't expect combat, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.68,1:05:03.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.28,1:05:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急电源 准备再次开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency power. Prepare to return fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.49,1:05:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特 可以将电源接到武器系统吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Scott, can you transfer power to phaser banks?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.04,1:05:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕不行 他们击中了自动操作系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so. They've knocked out the automation centre.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.21,1:05:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经失去太空舰的控制 苏鲁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got no control over anything. Mr Sulu?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.88,1:05:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也没办法 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.76,1:05:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么...我们只能坐以待毙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... we're a sitting duck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.35,1:05:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备发射逃生囊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to fire emergency tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.98,1:05:55.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何他们不消灭我们? 他们的火力比我们强大十倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why haven't they finished us? They outgun me ten to one!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.78,1:05:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令 敌方长官希望议和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Lord. The enemy commander wishes a truce to confer.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.41,1:06:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接上他们的影像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put them on screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.33,1:06:09.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是星联进取号的寇克将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Admiral James T. Kirk of the Federation Starship Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.79,1:06:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是创世计划的指挥官 你们违反了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Genesis Commander himself. A violation of treaty...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.17,1:06:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星联跟克林贡帝国的条约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...between the Federation and the Klingon Empire,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.80,1:06:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就等于向我们宣战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your presence here is an act of war.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.80,1:06:23.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有两分钟的时间弃舰投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have two minutes to surrender your crew and your vessel...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.47,1:06:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我们会击毁你们 他在隐瞒一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or we will destroy you. He's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.68,1:06:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的太空舰有可能已经被严重破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may have dealt him a more serious blow than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.02,1:06:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道? 我相信我的直觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you tell that? I trust my instincts.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.65,1:06:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寇克将军 我是敌方的司令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral Kirk, this is your opponent speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.36,1:06:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟我说什么条约了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't lecture me about treaty violations!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.70,1:06:47.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星联制造那么厉害的武器 就已经是违反条约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In creating an ultimate weapon, the Federation has become criminals!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.33,1:06:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会投降的 你们才应该投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not I who will surrender, it is you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.93,1:07:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那个星球上我们有三个人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the planet below, I have three prisoners
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.18,1:07:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是制造创世机的成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the team who developed your doomsday weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.89,1:07:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们不投降 我们会处决他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't surrender, I'll execute them as enemies of galactic peace!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.82,1:07:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是谁? 竟然够胆俘虏人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this? How dare you take prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.53,1:07:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是谁并不重要 那些人质才最重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who I am is not important. That I have them is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.91,1:07:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以跟他们通话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may speak to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.87,1:07:36.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 我是莎维可中尉 莎维可?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral, this is Lieutenant Saavik. Saavik!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.50,1:07:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫跟你在一起吗? 没错 还有另一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is David with you? Yes, and someone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.55,1:07:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个瓦肯星的科学家 你跟他很熟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Vulcan scientist of your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.64,1:07:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个瓦肯人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This... Vulcan...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.48,1:07:53.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还活著吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.06,1:07:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是以前的他了 不过他还活著\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is not himself, but he lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.90,1:07:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他老的非常快 就像这个星球一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's subject to rapid ageing, like this unstable planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.78,1:08:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 长官 我是大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, sir, it's David.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.41,1:08:05.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉我来迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.53,1:08:09.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早知道你会来的 没错 这个星球很不稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've known you'd come. It's true, this planet is unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.70,1:08:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在几小时内就会自我毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna destroy itself within hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.12,1:08:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫 创世星有什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, what went wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.25,1:08:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的问题 我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went wrong. I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.17,1:08:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉 请你千万别投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir. Just don't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.21,1:08:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创世计划失败了 我不相信他会杀了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genesis doesn't work. I can't believe they'd kill us for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.39,1:08:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都错了 我真的会杀了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral, your friend is mistaken, I meant what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.93,1:08:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了证明我的决心 我会先杀一个人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to show that my intentions are sincere, I shall kill one prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.81,1:08:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 让我再说一会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Give me a chance to talk...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.06,1:08:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便杀一个人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill one of them. I don't care which.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.82,1:09:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莎维可?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saavik?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.03,1:09:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.99,1:09:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 大卫已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admiral... David is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.47,1:09:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋 你杀了我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You Klingon bastard, you've killed my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.77,1:09:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 你杀了我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingon bastard, you've killed my son!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.20,1:10:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个克林贡混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You Klingon bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.03,1:10:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有两个人质 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are two more prisoners, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.66,1:10:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要他们死吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want them killed, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.25,1:10:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弃舰投降吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surrender your vessel.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.96,1:10:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. All right, damn you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.68,1:10:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.98,1:10:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我一分钟去告诉我的舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a minute to inform my crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.77,1:10:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你们两分钟时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give two minutes to you and your gallant crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.62,1:10:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集合所有舰员 带备武器 准备登船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take every last man, form a boarding party, armed heavily!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.04,1:11:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令 他们的人数比我们多 我们是克林贡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They outnumber us, my Lord. We are Klingons!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.29,1:11:04.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一控制太空舰 就将我们的旗帜搬过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you control the ship we will transfer our flag there
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.96,1:11:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要拿走他们的创世机程式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and take Genesis from their memory banks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.93,1:11:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏鲁 鸟形舰上有多少人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Sulu, what is the crew complement of a Bird of Prey?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.19,1:11:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约十多个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About a dozen officers and men.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.52,1:11:29.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一部分已经在创世星上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With some of them on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.11,1:11:34.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证我们还未完蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to you, we're not finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.99,1:11:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考伊跟苏鲁到传送室 其他的人跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, you and Sulu to the Transporter Room, the rest with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.41,1:11:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要大显身手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.54,1:11:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克林贡司令 准备上太空舰吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Klingon vessel. Prepare to board this ship on my next signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.63,1:11:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别使诈 寇克 你还有一分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tricks, Kirk! You have one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.72,1:11:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会使诈 我也很想见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tricks. I'm looking forward to meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.52,1:12:05.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到传送室去 祝你们成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the Transport Room. Success!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.57,1:12:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电脑 我是寇克将军 我要求进入系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, this is Admiral James T. Kirk, requesting security access.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.37,1:12:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电脑 毁灭程序一号...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, destruct Sequence One, Code: 1...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.88,1:12:29.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,密码11A\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1 A...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.05,1:12:40.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电脑 我是总工程师 史考特军官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, Commander Montgomery Scott, Chief Engineering Officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.39,1:12:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁灭程序二号 密码11A2B\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destruct Sequence Two, Code: 11 A 2B.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.69,1:12:56.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电脑 我是临时科学主管 帕维契可夫军官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer, this is Commander Pavel Chekov, acting Science Officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.45,1:13:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁灭程序三号 密码1B2B3\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destruct Sequence Three, Code: 1 B2B3.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.54,1:13:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁灭程序己被完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destruct Sequence completed and engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.92,1:13:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等候最后密码 随时开始一分钟倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awaiting final Code for one-minute countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.25,1:13:15.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,密码000\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code: 000.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.68,1:13:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁灭 0\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destruct 0.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.35,1:13:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁灭程序己被启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destruct Sequence is activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.57,1:13:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寇克 时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk, your time runs out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.90,1:13:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切准备妥当? 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All set? Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.28,1:13:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克林贡司令 我们正在开动传送装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Klingon vessel, we are energising transporter beam, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.29,1:13:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传送装置 准备开动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transporter, stand by!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.84,1:14:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令 他们好像放弃了太空舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Lord, the ship appears to be deserted.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.51,1:14:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能? 他们只是躲起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can that be? They're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.93,1:14:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 司令 但太空舰好像是被电脑操纵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, but the bridge seems to be run by computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.85,1:14:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是唯一发出声音的东西 发出声音? 让我听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only thing speaking. Speaking? Let me hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.40,1:14:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九、八、七、六...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine, eight, seven, six...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.28,1:15:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五 快走...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...five... Get out! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.36,1:15:02.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! ...one...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.17,1:16:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考伊 我做的对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, Bones. What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.38,1:16:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别无选择 你一定要那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you had to do. What you always do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.64,1:16:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望死亡能换来生存的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn death into a fighting chance to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.23,1:16:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行星核心不稳定 正在快速变化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Planet core readings, unstable. Changing rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.36,1:16:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行星表面有生命迹象吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about surface life signs?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.61,1:16:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.95,1:17:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碰他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Don't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.38,1:18:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.71,1:18:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事? 他牺牲自己来救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened? He gave his life to save us.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.97,1:18:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他衰老的很快 所有遗传功能都加速了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rapid ageing. All genetic functions highly accelerated.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.64,1:19:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的脑袋呢? 他的脑袋是空的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about his mind? His mind's a void.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.94,1:19:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的灵魂似乎全附在我身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems, Admiral, that I've got all his marbles.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.11,1:19:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能做什么? 只有一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything we can do? Only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.07,1:19:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他离开这里 他的衰老是因为这个行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him off this planet. His ageing is part of what's going on around us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.14,1:19:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克林贡司令 我是寇克将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingon Commander, this is Admiral James T. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.48,1:19:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还活著 正在行星的表面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm alive and well on the planet's surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.65,1:19:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定会感到很惊奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this will come as a pleasant surprise to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.82,1:19:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太空舰的爆炸只是一个意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our ship was a victim of an unfortunate accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.61,1:19:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉 但生活就是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about your crew, but as we say on Earth, "C'est la vie".
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.12,1:20:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拥有你想要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.62,1:20:05.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道创世机的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the secret of Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.67,1:20:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得传送我们到你的太空舰 才能得到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to bring us up there to get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.05,1:20:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.05,1:20:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在等你回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.02,1:20:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的答案为何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your answer?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.49,1:20:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下所有武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop all weapons!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.96,1:20:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了寇克之外 全到那边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there, all but Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.05,1:20:59.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人已经在传送机的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maltz... Prisoners at beam coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.43,1:21:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该连这个瓦肯星人也送走 不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should take the Vulcan too. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.85,1:21:05.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么? 因为这是你的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why? Because you wish it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.27,1:21:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maltz... Activate beam!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.20,1:21:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要知道创世机的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genesis. I want it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.50,1:21:27.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将这个瓦肯星人送走 我们才有得谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beam the Vulcan up, and we'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.08,1:21:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你满足我的要求 我会考虑将他送走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me what I want and I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.21,1:21:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻瓜 你看看这里 这个行星快要毁灭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fool! Look around you! The planet's destroying itself!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.96,1:21:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 这不是很兴奋吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, exhilarating, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.43,1:21:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们不互相帮助 我们都会死在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't help each other, we'll die here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.43,1:21:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 我们就死在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect! Then that's the way it shall be.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.03,1:22:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将创世机给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me Genesis!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.51,1:23:09.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的手给我 寇克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand! Kirk!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.11,1:23:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... have had...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.03,1:23:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受够你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.98,1:24:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maltz!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.46,1:25:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动 还有多少人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't! How many more?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.76,1:25:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有他而己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just him, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.34,1:25:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考伊 看看史波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, help Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.47,1:25:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须脱离轨道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to break out of orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.60,1:25:13.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不帮我们 我们就杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, help us or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.89,1:25:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not deserve to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.48,1:25:20.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我迟些才杀你 你现在给我滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, I'll kill you later. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.91,1:25:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个是反物质装置? 这个吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the anti-matter inducer? This?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.12,1:25:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! This!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.25,1:25:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看运气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.09,1:25:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我没有看错 我们有最高能量了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I read this right, sir, we have full power.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.64,1:25:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就马上离开 苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.48,1:26:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, David.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.45,1:26:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经安全 可以自由驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are clear and free to navigate.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.57,1:26:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全速飞往瓦肯星 契可夫 把犯人带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best speed to Vulcan. Mr Chekov, take the prisoner below.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.08,1:26:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 你刚才说会杀了我 我骗你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! You said you would kill me. I lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.63,1:26:28.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.34,1:26:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看在老天份上 跟我说说话吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God's sake, talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.60,1:26:37.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把你的灵魂附在我的身上 记得吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stuck this damn thing in my head, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.48,1:26:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.10,1:26:44.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我应该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, tell me what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.86,1:26:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.17,1:27:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些话必须告诉你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna tell you something that I...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.13,1:27:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从未想过我会这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...never thought I'd hear myself say.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.72,1:27:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我很想念你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it seems I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.69,1:27:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能忍受再次失去你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I could stand to lose you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.79,1:27:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们正往这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambassador, they are on approach.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.29,1:27:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要求批准降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're requesting permission to land.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.92,1:27:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,批准 告诉他们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission granted. Tell them...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.22,1:27:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉寇克 我们准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Kirk we'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.65,1:28:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏鲁 你正在手动驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Sulu, you're on manual.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.82,1:28:11.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,己驾驶一段时间了 就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while, sir. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.08,1:28:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逆向推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retrothrusters.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.34,1:29:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙瑞克己在上头等候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarek is waiting above, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.78,1:30:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙瑞克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarek...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.16,1:30:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史贡的孩子 苏卡尔的孩子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Child of Skon, child of Solkar...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.66,1:30:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你儿子的躯体仍有气息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The body of your son breathes still.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.75,1:30:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愿望是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your wish?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.09,1:30:38.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要求你施展浮图邦法术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ask for Fal-Tor-Pan. The refusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.72,1:30:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种法术己很久没有用过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you seek has not been done since ages past,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.76,1:30:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且只有在传说中才存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then only in legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.23,1:30:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的请求太不合理了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your request is not logical.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.85,1:30:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诘原谅我 女祭司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, T'Lar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.19,1:31:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于我儿子的事 我是不讲逻辑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My logic is uncertain where my son is concerned.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.45,1:31:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是他灵魂的看守人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is the keeper of the Katra?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.20,1:31:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.87,1:31:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷纳得麦考伊 大卫的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCoy, Leonard H., son of David.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.46,1:31:16.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考伊 大卫的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCoy, Son of David...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.25,1:31:19.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你是地球人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since thou art human, we cannot expect thee
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.21,1:31:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不期望你会完全了解沙瑞克的请求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to understand fully what Sarek has requested.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.59,1:31:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克的躯体仍然活著\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock's body lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.80,1:31:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你愿意的话我们将会尽全力...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your approval, we shall use all our powers
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.81,1:31:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将他的灵魂从你身上归回原处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to return to his body that which you possess.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.77,1:31:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你必须知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But McCoy, you must now be warned.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.07,1:31:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟他都会有极大的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The danger to thyself is as grave as the danger to Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.58,1:31:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须作出选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must make the choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.96,1:31:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我选择冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I choose the danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.21,1:32:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问得可真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell of a time to ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.24,1:35:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事的 寇克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.54,1:35:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史波克怎样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Spock?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.41,1:35:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有时间能证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only time will answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.00,1:35:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寇克...我很感谢你你所做的事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk... I thank you. What you have done is...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.42,1:35:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所做的事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I have done...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.63,1:35:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.68,1:35:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但代价是什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But at what cost?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.72,1:35:39.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的星舰和你的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ship. Your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.23,1:35:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我不尝试的话...我将会良心不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I hadn't tried... the cost would have been my soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.24,1:37:26.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲说你是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father says that you have been my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.46,1:37:29.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是为了我而来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came back for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.71,1:37:33.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也会为我这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would have done the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.17,1:37:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你会这么做呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.06,1:37:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为牺牲小我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the needs of the one...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.52,1:37:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能成全大我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...outweigh the needs of the many.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.21,1:38:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.04,1:38:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也永远是你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and ever shall be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.80,1:38:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.26,1:38:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 史波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Spock!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.47,1:38:25.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星舰安全脱险吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship. Out of danger?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.56,1:38:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拯救了星舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.31,1:38:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拯救了大家 你不记得吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved us all. Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.24,1:38:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.16,1:38:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字叫吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name is Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.33,1:38:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
